  (gr_text "NOTES:\n1) orange outline is the Panel PCB outline\n2) white outline is 15mm added on for possible mounting on to a wooden case\n3) lcd window may only work for a thin OLED display; thicker LED backlit \n	LCD displays will require a larger cutout to accomodate the LCD Bezel\n4) encoder knob/wheel hole diamteter is 42mm, original Zyklus encoder wheel\n	requires 58mm diameter hole" (at 175.26 346.71) (layer "Cmts.User") (tstamp 30dcd3e9-8ccb-45f0-97ea-1944d866bea4)
